    `dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b`): code 5 460 342 B, sha256
    ab00b841a57eaf3bd432b271c3b004b73a54f318f6c5bdd067106effe903739c; themes
    79 883 282 B, sha256
    413f943c835442962341b214c67d4615583192eaa0d83629871deeaf52cb71dc.
    Read back rather than inferred: version parity in three places (0.7 in
    `pyproject.toml`, `xigmalcd.__version__` and `dpkg-parsechangelog
    -SVersion`), one date across every archive member, `lintian
    --tag-display-limit 0` quiet, `FAN_TYPED` five times and `CPU PUMP` twice
    in the packaged bytes, and those bytes run against this machine's own
