    older package installed. Replaced with three claims that each have a
    source. The vendor's three are still pinned by length and MD5 and must
    be present, as a subset rather than as the whole set. The whole set
    must equal what the package declared it would install, read out of
    dpkg's own md5sums file for the package - a record rather than a second
    list kept by hand here - and the count prints either way, with the
    reason said out loud when there is no manifest to compare against. And
    the pairing has its own assertion now: for every drawn theme, the
